  {
   "path": "SCENE.md",
   "role": "instructions",
   "content": "# Loyalty Stamp Card\n\nA shop's stamp card with 8 to 10 slots: stamps press in one by one, a counter ticks up, and the last slot opens to the reward (\"GRATIS 1\"). The slot count, how many are filled and the reward text are variables.\n\nCategory: commerce. Length: 6 s. WebGL: no.\n\nUse when:\n- Telling regulars about a stamp or points card (\"beli 9, yang ke-10 gratis\").\n- A small shop's loyalty programme in a short promo.\n\nAvoid when:\n- A discount code to hand out: use voucher-ticket.\n- A one-time sale price: use price-drop.\n\nVariables:\n- shop (string): Shop name, default \"Kopi Senja\"\n- card_title (string): Card title, default \"Kartu stempel\"\n- slots (number, 6-10): Slots, default 10\n- filled (number, 0-10): Stamps filled, default 9\n- reward (string): Reward text, default \"GRATIS 1\"\n- note (string): Note, default \"Beli 9 kopi, yang ke-10 gratis\"\n- stamp_gap (number, 0.12-0.6): Gap between stamps, default 0.26\n- card_color (color): Card colour, default \"#ffffff\"\n- bg_color (color): Background, default \"#ffffff\"\n- text_color (color): Text colour, default \"#0a0a0a\"\n- muted_color (color): Muted colour, default \"#737373\"\n- main_color (color): Accent, default \"#2563eb\"\n- font_family (string): Font, default \"Geist\"\n- transparent (boolean): Transparent, default false\n\nSource: Mosio original. Licence: MIT. The scene file keeps the upstream notice.\n"
  },
  {
   "path": "scene.html",
   "role": "source",
   "content": "<!doctype html>\n<!--\n  Loyalty Stamp Card\n\n  A shop's stamp card with 8 to 10 slots: stamps press in one by one, a counter ticks up, and the last slot opens to the reward (\"GRATIS 1\"). The slot count, how many are filled and the reward text are variables.\n\n  An original usemosio/blocks block (MIT, see LICENSE).\n-->\n<html\n  lang=\"en\"\n  data-composition-id=\"loyalty-stamp-card\"\n  data-composition-duration=\"6\"\n  data-composition-variables='[\n  {\n    \"id\": \"shop\",\n    \"type\": \"string\",\n    \"role\": \"content\",\n    \"label\": \"Shop name\",\n    \"description\": \"Name printed on the card.\",\n    \"default\": \"Kopi Senja\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"card_title\",\n    \"type\": \"string\",\n    \"role\": \"content\",\n    \"label\": \"Card title\",\n    \"description\": \"Small label next to the shop name.\",\n    \"default\": \"Kartu stempel\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"slots\",\n    \"type\": \"number\",\n    \"role\": \"content\",\n    \"label\": \"Slots\",\n    \"description\": \"Number of slots on the card, the last one is the reward.\",\n    \"default\": 10,\n    \"min\": 6,\n    \"max\": 10,\n    \"step\": 1\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"filled\",\n    \"type\": \"number\",\n    \"role\": \"content\",\n    \"label\": \"Stamps filled\",\n    \"description\": \"How many stamps get pressed in. When this reaches slots minus one, the last slot opens to the reward.\",\n    \"default\": 9,\n    \"min\": 0,\n    \"max\": 10,\n    \"step\": 1\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"reward\",\n    \"type\": \"string\",\n    \"role\": \"content\",\n    \"label\": \"Reward text\",\n    \"description\": \"Text revealed in the last slot.\",\n    \"default\": \"GRATIS 1\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"note\",\n    \"type\": \"string\",\n    \"role\": \"content\",\n    \"label\": \"Note\",\n    \"description\": \"One line under the card. Leave empty to hide it.\",\n    \"default\": \"Beli 9 kopi, yang ke-10 gratis\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"stamp_gap\",\n    \"type\": \"number\",\n    \"role\": \"motion\",\n    \"label\": \"Gap between stamps\",\n    \"description\": \"Seconds between stamps.\",\n    \"default\": 0.26,\n    \"min\": 0.12,\n    \"max\": 0.6,\n    \"step\": 0.02\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"card_color\",\n    \"type\": \"color\",\n    \"role\": \"style\",\n    \"label\": \"Card colour\",\n    \"description\": \"Card surface.\",\n    \"default\": \"#ffffff\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"bg_color\",\n    \"type\": \"color\",\n    \"role\": \"style\",\n    \"label\": \"Background\",\n    \"description\": \"Background.\",\n    \"default\": \"#ffffff\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"text_color\",\n    \"type\": \"color\",\n    \"role\": \"style\",\n    \"label\": \"Text colour\",\n    \"description\": \"Main text and outlines.\",\n    \"default\": \"#0a0a0a\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"muted_color\",\n    \"type\": \"color\",\n    \"role\": \"style\",\n    \"label\": \"Muted colour\",\n    \"description\": \"Secondary text and hairlines.\",\n    \"default\": \"#737373\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"main_color\",\n    \"type\": \"color\",\n    \"role\": \"style\",\n    \"label\": \"Accent\",\n    \"description\": \"The reward slot: the one accent.\",\n    \"default\": \"#2563eb\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"font_family\",\n    \"type\": \"string\",\n    \"role\": \"style\",\n    \"label\": \"Font\",\n    \"description\": \"Font family name. Geist is loaded by default; another family must be loaded by the host.\",\n    \"default\": \"Geist\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"transparent\",\n    \"type\": \"boolean\",\n    \"role\": \"style\",\n    \"label\": \"Transparent\",\n    \"description\": \"Leave the background clear so the block sits over your own scene.\",\n    \"default\": false\n  }\n]'\n>\n  <head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n    <title>Loyalty Stamp Card</title>\n  </head>\n  <body>\n    <template>\n      <link\n        rel=\"stylesheet\"\n        href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Geist:wght@400;500;600;700&amp;display=block\"\n      />\n      <style>\n        #root {\n          position: absolute; inset: 0; overflow: hidden; container-type: size; pointer-events: none;\n          -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\n          color: var(--lc-text); font-family: var(--FAM, Geist), system-ui, sans-serif; background: var(--lc-bg);\n        }\n        #root * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n        .lc-stage { position: absolute; inset: 0; --u: calc(100cqmin / 1080); }\n\n        .lc-wrap { position: absolute; left: 50%; top: 50%; width: calc(var(--u) * 940); transform-origin: 50% 50%; }\n        .lc-card { width: 100%; padding: calc(var(--u) * 48); border-radius: calc(var(--u) * 44); background: var(--lc-card); border: calc(var(--u) * 2) solid rgba(10,10,10,0.1); box-shadow: 0 calc(var(--u) * 12) calc(var(--u) * 30) rgba(0,0,0,0.07); }\n        .lc-head { display: flex; align-items: flex-end; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: calc(var(--u) * 36); }\n        .lc-shop { font-size: calc(var(--u) * 58); font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.035em; line-height: 1.1; }\n        .lc-sub { font-size: calc(var(--u) * 28); font-weight: 500; color: var(--lc-muted); margin-top: calc(var(--u) * 8); }\n        .lc-count { font-size: calc(var(--u) * 58); font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.04em; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; line-height: 1.1; }\n        .lc-count span { color: var(--lc-muted); font-weight: 500; }\n        .lc-grid { display: grid; gap: calc(var(--u) * 20); }\n        .lc-slot { position: relative; aspect-ratio: 1; border-radius: 50%; border: calc(var(--u) * 3) dashed rgba(115,115,115,0.55); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: calc(var(--u) * 34); font-weight: 500; color: var(--lc-muted); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }\n        .lc-slot svg { position: absolute; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; overflow: visible; }\n        .lc-gift { position: absolute; inset: calc(var(--u) * -3); border-radius: 50%; background: var(--lc-main); color: #fff; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; text-align: center; font-size: calc(var(--u) * 36); font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.01em; line-height: 1.08; padding: calc(var(--u) * 14); text-wrap: balance; }\n        .lc-note { margin-top: calc(var(--u) * 34); text-align: center; font-size: calc(var(--u) * 32); font-weight: 500; color: var(--lc-muted); }\n\n      </style>\n\n      <div id=\"root\" data-composition-id=\"loyalty-stamp-card\" data-duration=\"6\" data-fps=\"30\">\n        <div id=\"lc-clip\" class=\"lc-stage clip\" data-start=\"0\" data-duration=\"6\" data-track-index=\"0\">\n\n          <div class=\"lc-wrap\" id=\"lc-wrap\">\n            <div class=\"lc-card\" id=\"lc-card\">\n              <div class=\"lc-head\"><div><div class=\"lc-shop\" id=\"lc-shop\"></div><div class=\"lc-sub\" id=\"lc-sub\"></div></div><div class=\"lc-count\" id=\"lc-count\"></div></div>\n              <div class=\"lc-grid\" id=\"lc-grid\"></div>\n              <div class=\"lc-note\" id=\"lc-note\"></div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/gsap@3.14.2/dist/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n        <script>\n          (function () {\n            \"use strict\";\n\n            var root = document.getElementById(\"root\");\n            var vars = window.__hyperframes && window.__hyperframes.getVariables ? window.__hyperframes.getVariables() || {} : {};\n            function num(v, d, a, b) { var n = Number(v); return Number.isFinite(n) ? Math.min(b, Math.max(a, n)) : d; }\n            function str(v, d) { return typeof v === \"string\" && v.trim() ? v : d; }\n            function colr(v, d) { return typeof v === \"string\" && v.trim() && window.CSS && CSS.supports(\"color\", v.trim()) ? v.trim() : d; }\n            function bool(v, d) { return v === true || v === \"true\" ? true : v === false || v === \"false\" ? false : d; }\n            function el(tag, cls, parent, html) { var e = document.createElement(tag); if (cls) e.className = cls; if (html !== undefined) e.innerHTML = html; if (parent) parent.appendChild(e); return e; }\n            function svg(tag, attrs, parent) { var e = document.createElementNS(\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\", tag); for (var k in attrs) e.setAttribute(k, attrs[k]); if (parent) parent.appendChild(e); return e; }\n            function esc(s) { return String(s).replace(/&/g, \"&amp;\").replace(/</g, \"&lt;\"); }\n            function dots(n) { return String(Math.round(n)).replace(/\\B(?=(\\d{3})+(?!\\d))/g, \".\"); }\n            function rp(n) { return \"Rp\" + dots(n); }\n            function money(s) { var d = String(s).replace(/[^\\d]/g, \"\"); return d ? parseInt(d, 10) : 0; }\n            function list(s, d) { var a = String(str(s, d)).split(\";\").map(function (x) { return x.trim(); }).filter(Boolean); return a.length ? a : String(d).split(\";\").map(function (x) { return x.trim(); }); }\n            function mulberry(seed) { var a = seed >>> 0; return function () { a = (a + 0x6D2B79F5) >>> 0; var t = a; t = Math.imul(t ^ (t >>> 15), t | 1); t ^= t + Math.imul(t ^ (t >>> 7), t | 61); return ((t ^ (t >>> 14)) >>> 0) / 4294967296; }; }\n            function setColors(p, c) { for (var k in c) root.style.setProperty(\"--\" + p + \"-\" + k, colr(vars[k + \"_color\"], c[k])); }\n            var fam = str(vars.font_family, \"Geist\");\n            root.style.setProperty(\"--FAM\", /^[\\w\\s-]+$/.test(fam) ? '\"' + fam + '\"' : \"Geist\");\n            var W = root.clientWidth || 1080, H = root.clientHeight || 1920, U = Math.min(W, H) / 1080, PORTRAIT = H > W;\n            if (bool(vars.transparent, false)) root.style.background = \"transparent\";\n\n            setColors(\"lc\", { bg: \"#f4f4f5\", text: \"#0a0a0a\", muted: \"#737373\", main: \"#2563eb\", card: \"#ffffff\" });\n\n\n            root.style.setProperty(\"--lc-card\", colr(vars.card_color, \"#ffffff\"));\n            var slots = Math.round(num(vars.slots, 10, 6, 10));\n            var stamps = Math.min(Math.round(num(vars.filled, 9, 0, 10)), slots - 1);\n            var reveal = Math.round(num(vars.filled, 9, 0, 10)) >= slots - 1;\n            var gap = num(vars.stamp_gap, 0.26, 0.12, 0.6);\n            document.getElementById(\"lc-shop\").textContent = str(vars.shop, \"Kopi Senja\");\n            document.getElementById(\"lc-sub\").textContent = str(vars.card_title, \"Kartu stempel\");\n            var note = typeof vars.note === \"string\" ? vars.note.trim() : \"Beli 9 kopi, yang ke-10 gratis\";\n            var noteEl = document.getElementById(\"lc-note\");\n            noteEl.textContent = note; if (!note) noteEl.style.display = \"none\";\n            var cols = Math.ceil(slots / 2);\n            var grid = document.getElementById(\"lc-grid\");\n            grid.style.gridTemplateColumns = \"repeat(\" + cols + \", 1fr)\";\n            var rnd = mulberry(11);\n            var slotEls = [], inks = [];\n            for (var i = 0; i < slots; i++) {\n              var s = el(\"div\", \"lc-slot\", grid);\n              el(\"span\", \"lc-n\", s, String(i + 1));\n              slotEls.push(s);\n              if (i < stamps) {\n                var sv = svg(\"svg\", { viewBox: \"0 0 100 100\" }, s);\n                var g = svg(\"g\", { fill: \"none\", stroke: \"currentColor\" }, sv);\n                svg(\"circle\", { cx: 50, cy: 50, r: 42, \"stroke-width\": 4.5 }, g);\n                svg(\"circle\", { cx: 50, cy: 50, r: 34, \"stroke-width\": 1.6 }, g);\n                var pts = [];\n                for (var k = 0; k < 10; k++) { var r = k % 2 ? 11 : 24, a = -Math.PI / 2 + k * Math.PI / 5; pts.push((50 + r * Math.cos(a)).toFixed(2) + \",\" + (50 + r * Math.sin(a)).toFixed(2)); }\n                svg(\"polygon\", { points: pts.join(\" \"), fill: \"currentColor\", stroke: \"none\" }, g);\n                sv.style.color = \"var(--lc-text)\";\n                sv.dataset.rot = String(Math.round((rnd() - 0.5) * 24));\n                inks.push({ svg: sv, slot: s });\n              }\n            }\n            var gift = null;\n            if (reveal) { gift = el(\"div\", \"lc-gift\", slotEls[slots - 1]); gift.textContent = str(vars.reward, \"GRATIS 1\"); }\n            var countEl = document.getElementById(\"lc-count\");\n            function setCount(n) { countEl.innerHTML = Math.round(n) + \"<span>/\" + slots + \"</span>\"; }\n            setCount(0);\n\n            var wrap = document.getElementById(\"lc-wrap\");\n            var cardH = document.getElementById(\"lc-card\").offsetHeight;\n            var S = Math.min(1.7, (H * 0.84) / cardH, (W * 0.92) / (940 * U));\n            gsap.set(wrap, { xPercent: -50, yPercent: -50, scale: S });\n\n            var tl = gsap.timeline({ paused: true });\n            tl.fromTo(\"#lc-card\", { y: 50 * U, opacity: 0 }, { y: 0, opacity: 1, duration: 0.6, ease: \"power3.out\" }, 0.1);\n            var t0 = 0.95;\n            inks.forEach(function (o, i) {\n              var rot = Number(o.svg.dataset.rot) || 0;\n              var t = t0 + i * gap;\n              tl.fromTo(o.svg, { scale: 1.9, opacity: 0, rotation: rot }, { scale: 1, opacity: 1, rotation: rot, duration: 0.14, ease: \"power3.in\" }, t);\n              tl.fromTo(o.slot.firstChild, { opacity: 1 }, { opacity: 0, duration: 0.05 }, t + 0.1);\n              tl.fromTo(o.slot, { borderColor: \"rgba(115,115,115,0.55)\" }, { borderColor: \"rgba(115,115,115,0)\", duration: 0.05 }, t + 0.1);\n              tl.fromTo(o.slot, { scale: 1 }, { scale: 0.94, duration: 0.05, ease: \"power2.out\" }, t + 0.13);\n              tl.to(o.slot, { scale: 1, duration: 0.22, ease: \"back.out(2.5)\" }, t + 0.18);\n            });\n            if (stamps > 0) {\n              var cnt = { v: 0 };\n              tl.fromTo(cnt, { v: 0 }, { v: stamps, duration: stamps * gap, ease: \"steps(\" + stamps + \")\", onUpdate: function () { setCount(cnt.v); } }, t0 + 0.14 - gap);\n            }\n            if (gift) {\n              var tg = t0 + stamps * gap + 0.45;\n              tl.fromTo(gift, { scale: 0, opacity: 0 }, { scale: 1, opacity: 1, duration: 0.5, ease: \"back.out(1.5)\" }, tg);\n              tl.fromTo(slotEls[slots - 1].firstChild, { opacity: 1 }, { opacity: 0, duration: 0.05 }, tg);\n              tl.fromTo(countEl, { scale: 1 }, { scale: 1.12, duration: 0.15, ease: \"power2.out\", transformOrigin: \"100% 60%\" }, tg + 0.25);\n              tl.to(countEl, { scale: 1, duration: 0.3, ease: \"power2.out\" }, tg + 0.4);\n            }\n\n            var total = parseFloat(root.dataset.duration || \"6\");\n            if (tl.duration() < total) tl.to({}, { duration: total - tl.duration() });\n            tl.seek(0);\n            window.__timelines = window.__timelines || {};\n            window.__timelines[\"loyalty-stamp-card\"] = tl;\n          })();\n        </script>\n      </div>\n    </template>\n  </body>\n</html>\n"
  }
 ],
